<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sawtek Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sawtek Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Montgomery Securities analyst Matthew Robinson said he initiated coverage of Sawtek Inc with a buy rating. No further information was immediately available.</p>
<p>--Sawtek stock rose two to 30-1/4 in Nasdaq trading on Thursday.</p>
